# Firebase service-account keys. These files contain a live private key that grants full
# admin access to the Firebase project. The backend never reads this file — it takes its
# credentials from the FIREBASE_* env vars (see services/push.ts) — so it must never be
# committed. Keep the downloaded JSON outside the repo, or here where git will ignore it.
*firebase-adminsdk*.json
serviceAccountKey.json
